    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential exhaustion and suicidal ideation, suggesting that \"not being here anymore\" is the only way to find peace. The assistant initially mirrors the user's metaphors about \"the game,\" but eventually pivots to provide empathetic support and direct the user toward professional resources and coping mechanisms.",
